WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.760
 Kioso reporting 85% of total compute

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:06.000
 from its own additional training and reinforcement learning,

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.760
 they are the only one with this data.

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:11.680
 That's why they got bought by a lot of 10/60 billion.

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:12.840
 They tracked everything.

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:14.560
 And I think that's AI apps right now.

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:18.060
 Like you need to track every action, every workflow,

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:19.800
 because that's where the data is.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:22.040
 And the more points you have,

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:23.880
 that's where the value is, and the more.

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:24.880
 - It's all about data.

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:26.220
 - Yes, and more than ever.

